{"seq":2,"slug":"backup-pitr","title":"逻辑/物理备份与时间点恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/mysql-performance-operations/ha-operations/backup-pitr","wordCount":2708,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"逻辑-物理备份与时间点恢复\">逻辑/物理备份与时间点恢复</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>备份的目标不是&quot;有一份数据副本&quot;，而是<strong>在需要时能在可接受的时间内恢复到可接受的时间点</strong>。这两个&quot;可接受&quot;分别对应两个指标：RTO（Recovery Time Objective，恢复耗时）与 RPO（Recovery Point Objective，可容忍的数据丢失量）。一份从未验证过恢复流程的备份，在这两个指标上都等于零。</p>\n<p>备份方案的选择几乎完全由数据量与 RTO 决定。数据量在几十 GB 以内、恢复可以慢，逻辑备份足够；数据量到几百 GB 到几 TB、恢复必须在一小时内完成，只能用物理备份。而 <strong>RPO 的达成不取决于备份本身，取决于 binlog 的保留策略</strong>——备份提供了&quot;某个时刻的完整状态&quot;，binlog 提供了&quot;从这个时刻到故障时刻的增量&quot;。两者必须衔接得上。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[全量备份 T0] --&gt; B[增量/差异备份 T1]&#10;  B --&gt; C[增量/差异备份 T2]&#10;  C --&gt; D[故障发生 T3]&#10;  A --&gt; E[binlog 持续归档&lt;br/&gt;T0 至今]&#10;  B --&gt; E&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; F[恢复流程]&#10;  F --&gt; G[1. 恢复最近的全量备份]&#10;  G --&gt; H[2. 依次应用增量备份&lt;br/&gt;直至 T2]&#10;  H --&gt; I[3. 用 binlog 重放到目标时间点&lt;br/&gt;或最后一个完整事务]&#10;  I --&gt; J[4. 验证数据一致性与业务正确性]&#10;  E -.衔接断点检查.-&gt; I\">graph TD\n  A[全量备份 T0] --&gt; B[增量/差异备份 T1]\n  B --&gt; C[增量/差异备份 T2]\n  C --&gt; D[故障发生 T3]\n  A --&gt; E[binlog 持续归档&lt;br/&gt;T0 至今]\n  B --&gt; E\n  C --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; F[恢复流程]\n  F --&gt; G[1. 恢复最近的全量备份]\n  G --&gt; H[2. 依次应用增量备份&lt;br/&gt;直至 T2]\n  H --&gt; I[3. 用 binlog 重放到目标时间点&lt;br/&gt;或最后一个完整事务]\n  I --&gt; J[4. 验证数据一致性与业务正确性]\n  E -.衔接断点检查.-&gt; I</pre><p>这张图里最关键的是<strong>衔接</strong>：从 T2 到 T3 之间的 binlog 必须完整存在。如果 binlog 因为空间不足被提前清理（<code>binlog_expire_logs_seconds</code> 到期或磁盘满触发的自动清理），那么 T2 之后的数据无法恢复——RPO 实际退化成&quot;到 T2 为止&quot;。这是备份策略中最常见的漏洞：备份做得很好，但 binlog 保留期短于备份周期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"逻辑备份-mysqldump-与-mysqlpump-的取舍\">逻辑备份：mysqldump 与 mysqlpump 的取舍</h2><p>逻辑备份导出的是一系列 SQL 语句（<code>CREATE TABLE</code> + <code>INSERT</code>）。它的优势在可移植性——可以跨版本、跨平台、跨引擎恢复，可以只恢复单表，导出内容是纯文本因而可被审查和编辑。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 一致性快照 + GTID 记录, 单事务导出(不锁表, 仅适用于 InnoDB)&#10;mysqldump --single-transaction \\&#10;  --source-data=2 \\&#10;  --set-gtid-purged=ON \\&#10;  --routines --triggers --events \\&#10;  --hex-blob \\&#10;  --databases mydb &gt; mydb_$(date +%F).sql&#10;&#10;# 只导出结构&#10;mysqldump --no-data mydb &gt; schema.sql&#10;&#10;# 恢复&#10;mysql &lt; mydb_2026-09-25.sql\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 一致性快照 + GTID 记录, 单事务导出(不锁表, 仅适用于 InnoDB)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mysqldump</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --single-transaction</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --source-data=2</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --set-gtid-purged=ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --routines</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --triggers</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --events</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --hex-blob</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --databases</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mydb</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mydb_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">date</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> +%F</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.sql</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 只导出结构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mysqldump</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --no-data</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mydb</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> schema.sql</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 恢复</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mysql</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mydb_2026-09-25.sql</span></span></code></pre></div><p>参数的选择都有明确理由：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>不用的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>--single-transaction</code></td>\n<td>用 RR 快照保证一致性，不锁表</td>\n<td>导出期间数据可能不一致；用 <code>--lock-all-tables</code> 又会阻塞写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--source-data=2</code></td>\n<td>在导出中加入 <code>CHANGE MASTER</code> 注释行，记录位点</td>\n<td>无法确定 binlog 衔接起点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--set-gtid-purged=ON</code></td>\n<td>记录 GTID 集合</td>\n<td>恢复后无法直接用 <code>AUTO_POSITION</code> 接上复制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--hex-blob</code></td>\n<td>二进制列用十六进制表示</td>\n<td>二进制数据在文本传输中可能被损坏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--routines --triggers --events</code></td>\n<td>导出存储过程/触发器/事件</td>\n<td>恢复后业务逻辑缺失，运行时报错</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--quick</code></td>\n<td>逐行取结果不缓存整个结果集</td>\n<td>大表导出可能耗尽客户端内存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>--single-transaction</code> 的机制是：在导出开始时开启一个 <code>REPEATABLE READ</code> 事务并创建 ReadView，之后所有表的读取都基于这个快照。这带来两个后果必须知道：</p>\n<p>一是<strong>它只对 InnoDB 有效</strong>。如果库里混有 MyISAM 表，那部分数据仍可能在导出期间变化，需要额外处理（<code>--lock-all-tables</code> 会阻塞写入）。</p>\n<p>二是<strong>它是一个长事务</strong>。导出 1TB 数据可能持续数小时，这数小时里 ReadView 一直存在，undo 无法回收——正是 <a href=\"../transactions-locking/long-transactions-undo\">长事务、purge 线程与 undo 膨胀</a> 里描述的最坏情况。所以在大实例上做逻辑备份，应该从<strong>从库</strong>而不是主库执行，让 undo 压力落在从库上。</p>\n<p>逻辑备份的另一个问题是恢复速度。恢复时需要逐条执行 <code>INSERT</code>，且要重建索引。对一张有 10 个二级索引的表，逐行插入意味着每行都要维护 11 棵树——比物理恢复慢一个数量级。所以 mysqldump 的适用范围大体是<strong>几十 GB 以内</strong>。MySQL 8.0.21 引入的 <code>util.dumpSchemas()</code>（MySQL Shell 的并行导出）能显著加速，它使用 <code>SELECT ... INTO</code> 快速格式且支持分片并行，比 mysqldump 快数倍，但仍是逻辑备份，恢复时同样要重建索引。</p>\n<h2 id=\"物理备份-xtrabackup-的工作原理\">物理备份：XtraBackup 的工作原理</h2><p>物理备份直接复制 InnoDB 的表空间文件与日志文件，因此不受&quot;逐行插入&quot;的限制。Percona XtraBackup 8.4 是当前的主流选择（与 MySQL 8.4 配套）。</p>\n<p>它的核心难点是<strong>保证备份的一致快照</strong>。InnoDB 的数据文件在备份过程中一直在变化，直接复制会得到一个&quot;页与页之间不一致&quot;的文件集合（比如某个事务改了页 A 还没改页 B）。XtraBackup 的解法是备份时持续复制 redo 日志，恢复前用这些 redo 对数据文件做&quot;崩溃恢复&quot;——把不一致的页集合推到某个一致点。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 全量备份&#10;xtrabackup --backup \\&#10;  --target-dir=/backup/full \\&#10;  --user=backup_user --password=&lt;credential&gt; \\&#10;  --parallel=4 --compress --compress-threads=4&#10;&#10;# 2. 准备(prepare): 用 redo 把数据文件推到一致状态&#10;xtrabackup --prepare --target-dir=/backup/full&#10;&#10;# 3. 恢复&#10;systemctl stop mysqld&#10;rm -rf /var/lib/mysql/*&#10;xtrabackup --copy-back --target-dir=/backup/full&#10;chown -R mysql:mysql /var/lib/mysql&#10;systemctl start mysqld\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 全量备份</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">xtrabackup</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --backup</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --target-dir=/backup/full</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --user=backup_user</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --password=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">credential</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --parallel=4</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --compress</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --compress-threads=4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. 准备(prepare): 用 redo 把数据文件推到一致状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">xtrabackup</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --prepare</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target-dir=/backup/full</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. 恢复</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">systemctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stop</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mysqld</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -rf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /var/lib/mysql/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">xtrabackup</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --copy-back</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target-dir=/backup/full</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chown</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -R</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mysql:mysql</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /var/lib/mysql</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">systemctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mysqld</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>--prepare</code> 这一步是关键，它做三件事：从 redo 日志重放已提交事务（<code>redo apply</code>）、回滚未提交事务（<code>undo rollback</code>）、以及让表空间与数据字典一致。<strong>没有 prepare 的备份是没用的</strong>。增量备份必须在 prepare 时先合入全量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 增量备份(基于上一次备份)&#10;xtrabackup --backup --target-dir=/backup/inc1 \\&#10;  --incremental-basedir=/backup/full&#10;&#10;# prepare 顺序: 先 prepare 全量(带 --apply-log-only), 再 prepare 增量&#10;xtrabackup --prepare --apply-log-only --target-dir=/backup/full&#10;xtrabackup --prepare --target-dir=/backup/full --incremental-dir=/backup/inc1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 增量备份(基于上一次备份)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">xtrabackup</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --backup</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target-dir=/backup/inc1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --incremental-basedir=/backup/full</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># prepare 顺序: 先 prepare 全量(带 --apply-log-only), 再 prepare 增量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">xtrabackup</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --prepare</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --apply-log-only</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target-dir=/backup/full</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">xtrabackup</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --prepare</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target-dir=/backup/full</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --incremental-dir=/backup/inc1</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>--apply-log-only</code> 是增量恢复链上的必要参数：对中间阶段的增量做 prepare 时必须加它，否则 InnoDB 会回滚未提交事务，导致后续增量无法再合入。<strong>只有最后一个增量在 prepare 时才不加 <code>--apply-log-only</code></strong>。这是手工操作中最容易出错的一步。</p>\n<p>XtraBackup 的一个重要约束是<strong>版本兼容性</strong>：XtraBackup 8.4 只能备份 MySQL 8.4（以及部分 8.0.x 的较新版本），跨主版本恢复不受支持。升级 MySQL 时要同步升级备份工具，并重新验证恢复流程。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比项</th>\n<th>逻辑备份</th>\n<th>物理备份</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>备份速度（1TB）</td>\n<td>数小时</td>\n<td>十几分钟到一小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恢复速度（1TB）</td>\n<td>数十小时</td>\n<td>十几分钟到一小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单表恢复</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>不支持（除非用 <code>import tablespace</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨版本恢复</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可读性</td>\n<td>纯文本可审查</td>\n<td>二进制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对源库压力</td>\n<td>有（需读全表 + 长事务）</td>\n<td>低（顺序复制文件）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量备份</td>\n<td>需 binlog</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间占用</td>\n<td>约等于数据量</td>\n<td>约等于数据量（可压缩）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个常见的组合策略是<strong>物理备份做日常（快、支持增量），逻辑备份做定期（每周或每月，用于长期归档与跨版本迁移的保底）</strong>。这个组合同时覆盖了&quot;快速恢复&quot;与&quot;可移植&quot;两个需求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时间点恢复的完整流程\">时间点恢复的完整流程</h2><p>&quot;恢复到 14:32:10 之前&quot;这样的需求，靠的是全量备份 + binlog 重放。流程与每一步的耗时估算：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 步骤 1: 恢复全量备份并 prepare&#10;xtrabackup --prepare --target-dir=/backup/full&#10;xtrabackup --copy-back --target-dir=/backup/full&#10;&#10;# 步骤 2: 启动实例但禁止外部连接(避免新写入污染恢复过程)&#10;#   my.cnf: skip-networking=ON  (或用 --skip-networking 启动)&#10;&#10;# 步骤 3: 用 mysqlbinlog 从备份记录的位点重放到目标时间&#10;mysqlbinlog --start-position=&lt;from_backup&gt; \\&#10;  --stop-datetime=&#39;2026-09-25 14:32:10&#39; \\&#10;  /backup/binlog/binlog.000123 /backup/binlog/binlog.000124 \\&#10;  | mysql -u root&#10;&#10;# 步骤 4: 校验&#10;#   检查关键表的行数与业务约束, 确认目标时间点之后的事务确实未应用\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 步骤 1: 恢复全量备份并 prepare</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">xtrabackup</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --prepare</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target-dir=/backup/full</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">xtrabackup</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --copy-back</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target-dir=/backup/full</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 步骤 2: 启动实例但禁止外部连接(避免新写入污染恢复过程)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   my.cnf: skip-networking=ON  (或用 --skip-networking 启动)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 步骤 3: 用 mysqlbinlog 从备份记录的位点重放到目标时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mysqlbinlog</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --start-position=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">from_backup</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --stop-datetime=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-09-25 14:32:10'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  /backup/binlog/binlog.000123</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /backup/binlog/binlog.000124</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mysql</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -u</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> root</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 步骤 4: 校验</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   检查关键表的行数与业务约束, 确认目标时间点之后的事务确实未应用</span></span></code></pre></div><p>四个容易出问题的细节：</p>\n<p><strong>细节一：<code>--stop-datetime</code> 的语义是&quot;包含边界在内&quot;还是&quot;不包含&quot;。</strong> 实际行为是<strong>包含</strong>到该时间点的事件。如果要精确排除某条误操作的语句，用 <code>--stop-position</code> 更可靠——先用 <code>mysqlbinlog</code> 定位误操作语句的位置，然后 stop 在它之前：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 定位误操作(找到 DELETE 的位点)&#10;mysqlbinlog --base64-output=DECODE-ROWS -v --start-datetime=&#39;2026-09-25 14:30:00&#39; \\&#10;  /backup/binlog/binlog.000124 | grep -n -A5 -B5 &#39;DELETE FROM orders&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 定位误操作(找到 DELETE 的位点)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mysqlbinlog</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --base64-output=DECODE-ROWS</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -v</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --start-datetime=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-09-25 14:30:00'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  /backup/binlog/binlog.000124</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -A5</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -B5</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DELETE FROM orders'</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>细节二：<code>ROW</code> 格式的 binlog 需要 <code>-v</code> 才能显示可读内容</strong>（<code>-vv</code> 会更详细地显示列类型）。默认输出是 base64 编码的行事件，不可读。</p>\n<p><strong>细节三：GTID 模式下用 <code>--exclude-gtids</code> 或 <code>--skip-gtids</code>。</strong> 如果目标实例的 <code>gtid_executed</code> 已经包含某些 GTID，直接重放会冲突。<code>--skip-gtids</code> 让重放的语句不携带 GTID，适合恢复到独立实例；要保留 GTID 一致性则用 <code>--exclude-gtids</code> 精确排除。</p>\n<p><strong>细节四：恢复期间的实例不应接受写入。</strong> 重放过程中如果应用连上来并写入，会与重放的事务交错，产生难以预料的结果。标准做法是用 <code>--skip-networking</code> 或防火墙隔离。</p>\n<p><strong>耗时估算。</strong> 恢复总时间是三段之和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{total} = T_{restore} + T_{prepare} + T_{replay}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{restore}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是复制文件的时间（受磁盘吞吐限制，1TB 在千兆盘上约 30–60 分钟），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{prepare}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 redo 重放时间（取决于备份时产生的 redo 量），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{replay}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 binlog 重放时间（取决于要重放的事务量，单线程重放约每秒几万事务，但含大事务时会显著变慢）。</p>\n<p>RTO 的估算必须包含这三段，且要留出验证时间。一个有用的做法是<strong>每季度做一次真实的恢复演练</strong>并记录实际耗时——这个数字才是 RTO 的真值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"备份有效性验证\">备份有效性验证</h2><p>未验证的备份等于没有备份。验证分三个层次，成本递增。</p>\n<p><strong>层次一：备份产物完整性检查（每次备份后自动做）。</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 检查备份日志中是否有错误&#10;grep -iE &#39;error|fail&#39; /backup/full/xtrabackup.log&#10;&#10;# 检查关键文件是否存在&#10;test -f /backup/full/xtrabackup_checkpoints &amp;&amp; cat /backup/full/xtrabackup_checkpoints&#10;# 输出中的 to_lsn / last_lsn 应该相等(表示已 prepare)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检查备份日志中是否有错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -iE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'error|fail'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /backup/full/xtrabackup.log</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检查关键文件是否存在</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /backup/full/xtrabackup_checkpoints</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /backup/full/xtrabackup_checkpoints</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出中的 to_lsn / last_lsn 应该相等(表示已 prepare)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>xtrabackup_checkpoints</code> 文件的内容是判断备份状态的关键：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"backup_type = full-prepared&#10;from_lsn = 0&#10;to_lsn = 34125000&#10;last_lsn = 34125000\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>backup_type = full-prepared</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>from_lsn = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>to_lsn = 34125000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>last_lsn = 34125000</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>last_lsn</code> 与 <code>to_lsn</code> 相等说明已正确 prepare；<code>backup_type</code> 为 <code>full-prepared</code> 而非 <code>full-backuped</code> 说明 prepare 成功。</p>\n<p><strong>层次二：恢复到临时实例并校验（每周）。</strong> 把备份恢复到一个独立的临时实例，跑几个校验查询（关键表的 <code>COUNT(*)</code>、业务不变量的检查），确认数据可用。这个过程可以自动化。</p>\n<p><strong>层次三：完整的恢复演练（每季度）。</strong> 包括 binlog 重放与业务侧验证。这一步能发现&quot;备份能恢复但恢复后应用跑不起来&quot;一类的问题（比如存储过程缺失、用户权限未导出、字符集不一致）。</p>\n<p><strong>校验数据的正确性需要工具。</strong> <code>pt-table-checksum</code> 可以逐块计算主从的校验和，找出不一致的行；<code>pt-table-sync</code> 用于修复。它们的工作原理是在主库上分块计算 <code>CHECKSUM</code> 并写入一张表，然后从库重放这个计算并比对——因此不会造成巨大的锁或复制压力（分块 + 可控的暂停）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pt-table-checksum --host=primary --databases=mydb \\&#10;  --chunk-size=1000 --max-load=&#39;Threads_running=25&#39; \\&#10;  --replicate=percona.checksums&#10;&#10;# 查看不一致的表&#10;pt-table-checksum --replicate=percona.checksums --host=primary --databases=mydb\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pt-table-checksum</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --host=primary</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --databases=mydb</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --chunk-size=1000</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --max-load=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Threads_running=25'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --replicate=percona.checksums</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看不一致的表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pt-table-checksum</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --replicate=percona.checksums</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --host=primary</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --databases=mydb</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一个需要明确的边界：校验和只能发现&quot;数据不同&quot;，不能判断&quot;哪个是对的&quot;。它也不能替代业务层面的对账（比如订单金额总和与支付系统的一致性）。对账属于 <a href=\"../../distributed-transactions-consistency/\">分布式事务与一致性</a> 一类的跨系统问题，不在单实例备份的范围内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>备份的目标是达成 RTO 与 RPO，而不是&quot;有一份副本&quot;；未验证恢复流程的备份在这两个指标上等于零。</li>\n<li>RPO 由 <strong>binlog 保留策略</strong>决定，不由备份频率决定；<code>binlog_expire_logs_seconds</code> 短于备份周期是备份策略最典型的漏洞。</li>\n<li>逻辑备份（<code>mysqldump</code> / MySQL Shell <code>util.dumpSchemas</code>）可移植、支持单表恢复，但恢复慢且 <code>--single-transaction</code> 是一个长事务（应放在从库执行）。</li>\n<li>物理备份（XtraBackup 8.4）速度快、支持增量，但版本绑定严格、不支持单表恢复；<code>--prepare</code> 是不可省略的一步。</li>\n<li>增量备份链的 prepare 顺序固定：中间增量必须带 <code>--apply-log-only</code>，只有最后一个不加；否则未提交事务会被提前回滚导致链路失效。</li>\n<li>时间点恢复的三段耗时（文件复制 + prepare + binlog 重放）都要计入 RTO，且必须包含验证时间；用 <code>--stop-position</code> 比 <code>--stop-datetime</code> 更精确。</li>\n<li><code>ROW</code> 格式 binlog 需 <code>mysqlbinlog -v</code> 才可读；GTID 模式下用 <code>--skip-gtids</code> 或 <code>--exclude-gtids</code> 处理冲突。</li>\n<li>备份验证分三层：产物完整性（每次）、恢复到临时实例（每周）、完整恢复演练（每季度）。<code>xtrabackup_checkpoints</code> 中 <code>to_lsn == last_lsn</code> 是 prepare 成功的标志。</li>\n<li>数据一致性校验用 <code>pt-table-checksum</code>，它只能发现差异不能判定正确性，也不能替代跨系统对账。</li>\n<li>binlog 的物理格式与 GTID 的语义见 <a href=\"../innodb-internals/redo-undo-binlog\">redo/undo/binlog 与两阶段提交</a> 与 <a href=\"replication-gtid\">主从复制、GTID 与并行复制</a>；恢复后要接上复制需要 GTID 衔接；备份恢复的表如果需要改结构，见 <a href=\"online-ddl-gh-ost\">Online DDL 与 gh-ost 大表变更</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参考：Percona XtraBackup 8.4 Documentation <a href=\"https://docs.percona.com/percona-xtrabackup/8.4/\">https://docs.percona.com/percona-xtrabackup/8.4/</a>；MySQL Backup and Recovery Best Practices <a href=\"https://www.percona.com/blog/mysql-backup-and-recovery-best-practices/\">https://www.percona.com/blog/mysql-backup-and-recovery-best-practices/</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"逻辑/物理备份与时间点恢复","id":"逻辑-物理备份与时间点恢复"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"逻辑备份：mysqldump 与 mysqlpump 的取舍","id":"逻辑备份-mysqldump-与-mysqlpump-的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"物理备份：XtraBackup 的工作原理","id":"物理备份-xtrabackup-的工作原理"},{"level":2,"text":"时间点恢复的完整流程","id":"时间点恢复的完整流程"},{"level":2,"text":"备份有效性验证","id":"备份有效性验证"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"主从复制、GTID 与并行复制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/mysql-performance-operations/ha-operations/replication-gtid"},"next":{"title":"Online DDL 与 gh-ost 大表变更","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/mysql-performance-operations/ha-operations/online-ddl-gh-ost"}}